  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一款面向<strong>包开发者</strong>的模组，旨在通过更多事件和工具来扩展&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a>&nbsp;的功能。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>功能特性</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">村民/流浪商人的交易事件（支持模组添加的村民）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔台相关事件</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">加载时修改 NBT 结构的事件</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以及更多功能！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>不提供向后移植版本！<br></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">请阅读 GitHub 页面上的详细说明。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>链接</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.almostreliable.com%252fmorejs%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/morejs\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 说明页面</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fThFnwZCyYY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
